# Copy this file to  .vercel.env  (gitignored) and fill in the values.
# The publish script pushes every KEY=VALUE below to your Vercel project, then deploys.
#
#   PUBLIC values (safe in the browser) MUST start with  VITE_
#   SECRET values (API keys) must NOT start with VITE_  - they stay server-side in /api
#
# Firebase apps: the 6 shared VITE_FIREBASE_* vars are injected automatically from the
# skill's shared config - do NOT repeat them here. Put only this app's own secrets here.

# Example secret read by api/example.ts (rename to your real key):
# SOME_API_KEY=

# gate mode only - the single shared password that unlocks the app's API:
# APP_PASSWORD=
